# Local WSL bridge config for this repo.
# Copy values you want into .wsl-local.env and adjust as needed.
# The scripts will try to auto-discover exercism.exe in your Windows Downloads
# folder, but setting EXERCISM_BIN explicitly is the most stable option.

# Windows or WSL path to the Exercism CLI.
# Examples:
# EXERCISM_BIN='C:\Users\Mert\Downloads\exercism-3.5.8-windows-64bit\exercism.exe'
# EXERCISM_BIN='/mnt/c/Users/Mert/Downloads/exercism-3.5.8-windows-64bit/exercism.exe'

# Optional: Windows SSH binary to use for git from WSL.
# Example:
# WINDOWS_SSH_BIN='C:\Windows\System32\OpenSSH\ssh.exe'

# Optional: private key path on Windows for GitLab/GitHub access.
# Example:
# WINDOWS_SSH_KEY='C:\Users\Mert\.ssh\id_ed25519'
